&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Screenshot your node graph&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paste prompts in Discord&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upload .json files to random file hosts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explain your setup in comment threads&lt;/li&gt;
